The Hero, Content Row, Carousel, Gallery, Callout and Audio blocks now keep the classes Volto gives every block (styles, and Volto Light Theme's classes for the neighbouring blocks such as `previous--has--same--backgroundColor`). They replaced them with their own, so Volto Light Theme's spacing between neighbouring blocks never applied to them. This changes the spacing around these blocks on existing pages: it now follows the same rules as the theme's own blocks.
